52. Zero-Shot vs One-Shot vs Few-Shot

Technique	Examples	Typical Use
Zero-Shot	0	Straightforward tasks
One-Shot	1	Demonstrating a pattern
Few-Shot	Few	Complex or specialized patterns

Easy Memory Trick

ZERO  → 0 examples
ONE   → 1 example
FEW   → Few examples

